  "changes": "Retain the reviewed password/refusal/product changes from84e. Replace warehouse observations to allow same-role wrappers around consistent complete views while retaining every numeric or conflicting projection. Include the bounded qualification-slice validator and implicit source-selection fix.",
  "executableReview": [
    "Launch-scope approval only. The final runtime must pass the five selected positive, defect and null controls before promotion. The first batch passed four 19-check baselines, all124 intended defect assertions, null19 and all16 lease recoveries.",
    "Traced the complete112-check compiled catalog. Only warehouse7b and total-reader callers2a,201a,2c reach the changed warehouse readers;7a is included for complete scenario closure. These five checks replace their84e results. The fourteen other newly measured checks retain unchanged complete scenarios and execution inputs.",
    "The final warehouse reader separates numeric controls from labels and resolves redundant same-role wrappers with the consumer declared identity matcher. Numeric projections, conflicting identities and incomplete independent rows remain checked. Forty inventory and23 total browser cases passed, including failure-first valid nesting and label-decoration cases.",
    "The validator-only changes affect eligibility of fixed independent qualification slices, not model prompts or browser/application behavior. They require membership in both source/current effective check populations, catalog identity/path/presence, unchanged complete scenarios/dependencies and all other policies. Source artifact identity and execution-scope proofs remain bound. Two failure-first saved-artifact test runs each passed four groups; altered identity, dependencies, policies and populations remain rejected.",
    "The93 historical checks retain their earlier reviewed contract-text and runtime equivalence evidence. Current document comparison proves their complete scenario inputs unchanged. Source changes since the prior measured runtime are limited to the traced warehouse reader and qualification validation; each listed artifact-to-final executable mapping is accepted only for its retained check slice. No mapping qualifies the replaced five warehouse checks.",
    "Original artifacts, original selection keys and source snapshots stay unchanged. The saved-source progression review confirms warehouse false failures in SpacetimeDBr2 and Convexr1 withheld six L3 feature groups; therefore old L3 work and corrected cohort comparisons cannot be reused. Fresh model testing remains gated on final qualification and immutable official image checks."
  ],
